<title>UK: SOCCER-EUROPEAN CLUB COMPETITION FIXTURES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EUROPEAN CLUB COMPETITION FIXTURES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following matches are being played in the UEFA Cup and European Cup champions' league this week (GMT kickoff times, supplied by UEFA):</p>
<p>Tuesday, November 19</p>
<p>UEFA Cup, third round, first leg</p>
<p>1500  Club Brugge (Belgium) v Schalke 04 (Germany)</p>
<p>1700  Monaco (France) v Hamburg (Germany)</p>
<p>1900  Helsingborg (Sweden) v Anderlecht (Belgium)</p>
<p>1945  Internazionale Milan (Italy) v Boavista (Portugal)</p>
<p>2000  Brondby (Denmark) v Karlsruhe (Germany)</p>
<p>2000  Metz (France) v Newcastle United (England)</p>
<p>2030  Valencia (Spain) v Besiktas (Turkey)</p>
<p>2045  Tenerife (Spain) v Feyenoord (Netherlands)</p>
<p>Wednesday November 20</p>
<p>Champions' league</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>1930  Rangers (Scotland) v Grasshopper (Switzerland)</p>
<p>1930  Ajax (Netherlands) v Auxerre (France)</p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>1930  Steaua Bucharest (Romania) v Atletico Madrid (Spain)</p>
<p>1930  Widzew Lodz (Poland) v Borussia Dortmund (Germany)</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>1930  Fenerbahce (Turkey) v Rapid Vienna (Austria)</p>
<p>1930  Manchester United (England) v Juventus (Italy)</p>
<p>Group D</p>
<p>1930  Rosenborg Trondheim (Norway) v IFK Gothenburg (Sweden)</p>
<p>1930  Porto (Portugal) v AC Milan (Italy)</p>
</text>
